[
  {
    "content_id": "10025001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;从前人烟稠密的城， 现在何其荒凉！ 从前扬威列邦的强国， 现在竟像寡妇！ 从前在诸省贵为公主， 现在却沦为奴婢！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她在夜间痛哭，泪流满面。 情人中没有一个前来安慰。 朋友都出卖她，与她为敌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;犹大饱受苦难和奴役， 被掳往远方，流落异邦， 找不到安居之所。 她在走投无路之际被追敌擒获。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;通往锡安的道路满目凄凉， 因为无人前去过节。 她的城门冷落， 她的祭司悲叹， 她的少女哀伤，她痛苦不已。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;仇敌做了她的主人， 她的敌人安逸发达。 因为她作恶多端， 耶和华叫她饱受困苦， 她的孩子被敌人掳去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;少女锡安的尊荣消逝， 她的首领像找不到草吃的鹿， 无力逃脱敌人的追赶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;在困苦流离中， 耶路撒冷想起昔日的荣华。 如今，她的人民落在敌人手中， 无人援救。 她的仇敌幸灾乐祸，嘲笑她的灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷罪大恶极， 沦为污秽之物。 从前尊重她的人看见她赤身裸体，就蔑视她。 她只能哀叹、退避。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她的裙子沾满污秽， 她未曾想过自己的结局。 她的败落令人震惊， 无人安慰。 她哭喊道：“耶和华啊， 仇敌已经获胜， 求你垂顾我的苦难！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;敌人伸手夺去她的一切珍宝。 她目睹外族人闯入圣殿， 耶和华禁止他们进入祂的会众。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;她的人民呻吟着四处觅食， 用珍宝换取粮食维生。 她说：“耶和华啊，求你垂顾我， 因为我被人蔑视。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;“路人啊，你们都无动于衷吗？ 你们看看， 耶和华向我发烈怒，降祸于我， 还有谁比我更痛苦呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;“祂从高天降下火来， 使火在我骨中燃烧； 祂在我脚前设下网罗， 使我返回； 祂使我凄凉孤寂，终日痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;“我的罪恶连接成轭， 祂亲手把它们绑在一起， 系在我的颈项上， 使我精疲力尽。 主把我交给我无力抵挡的敌人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;“主弃绝我所有的勇士， 召集军队攻击我， 打垮我的青年。 主践踏处女犹大， 如同在榨酒池中踩踏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;“我为此哭泣， 泪流满面， 却无人安慰、鼓励我。 我的儿女凄凉孤苦， 因为仇敌已经得胜。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;锡安伸手求助，却无人安慰她。 耶和华已命四周邻国与雅各为敌。 耶路撒冷在他们当中成了污秽之物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;“但耶和华是公义的， 因为我违背了祂的命令。 万国啊，请听我的话， 看看我的痛苦！ 我的少男少女都被掳去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;“我向情人们求助， 他们却欺骗我。 我的祭司和长老在觅食求生时， 倒毙在城中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;“耶和华啊， 看看我是多么痛苦！ 我愁肠百结， 我的心灵翻腾， 因为我极其悖逆。 街上有刀剑夺命， 家中有死亡笼罩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;“人们听见我的哀叹， 却无人安慰我。 敌人听说你降给我的灾难， 都幸灾乐祸。 愿你宣告的审判之日来临， 叫他们像我一样受苦！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;“愿他们的恶行都摆在你眼前！ 你怎样因我一切的罪恶而惩罚我， 愿你也照样惩罚他们！ 我叹息不绝，心中哀伤。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;主的怒气像乌云一样遮盖少女锡安， 祂将以色列的荣美从天上扔到地上。 祂发怒的时候并不顾念自己的脚凳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;主毫不留情地毁灭雅各一切的住处， 祂在烈怒中夷平犹大的堡垒， 让以色列及其首领蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;祂发烈怒毁灭以色列全军。 敌人袭来时，祂收回援手。 祂像烈焰一样吞噬雅各。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂张弓搭箭，宛若仇敌， 祂的右手蓄势待发， 祂杀了一切悦人眼目的人， 将祂的怒火撒向少女锡安的帐篷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主像敌人一样毁灭以色列， 吞噬她的宫殿，夷平她的堡垒， 使犹大人悲伤哀哭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂摧毁自己的居所， 如同摧毁花园； 祂摧毁祂所定的聚会之处， 使锡安的人民忘记安息日和节期。 祂在烈怒中弃绝所有的君王和祭司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;主撇弃自己的祭坛， 憎恶自己的圣所， 把耶路撒冷的殿墙交给敌人。 他们像过节一样， 在耶和华的殿中喧嚷吵闹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和华决意拆毁少女锡安的城墙， 祂拉了准线， 定意毁灭，绝不收手。 祂使城墙和壁垒一同悲哀哭泣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;锡安的城门陷入地中， 主已摧毁、砍断她的门闩。 她的君王和首领流落异邦， 律法不复存在， 她的先知得不到从耶和华而来的异象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;少女锡安的长老腰束麻布， 头蒙灰尘，坐在地上， 默然不语； 耶路撒冷的少女垂头至地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我哭得眼睛失明， 愁肠百结，肝胆欲碎， 因为人民惨遭毁灭， 儿童和婴孩昏倒在城中的街头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;孩子们问母亲： “哪里有饼和酒呢？” 他们像受伤的勇士， 昏倒在城中的街头， 在母亲怀中奄奄一息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;少女耶路撒冷啊，我该说什么呢？ 我把你比作什么呢？ 处女锡安啊，我用什么比作你，好安慰你呢？ 你的伤口深如海洋， 谁能医治你呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你的先知所见的异象虚假无用。 他们没有揭露你的罪恶， 以致你被掳。 他们给你的预言虚假谬误。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;路人都拍掌嘲笑你。 他们向少女耶路撒冷摇头， 嗤笑道： “这就是那被誉为完美无瑕、 普世喜悦的城吗？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;敌人都幸灾乐祸地讥讽你， 他们咬牙切齿地嗤笑说： “我们吞灭了她！ 这是我们期待已久的日子！ 我们终于见到这一天了！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和华实现了祂的计划， 成就了祂很久以前的应许。 祂毫不留情地毁灭了你， 使你的仇敌幸灾乐祸， 使你的敌人耀武扬威。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;少女锡安的城墙啊， 你要从心里向主呼求！ 你的眼泪要像江河一样昼夜涌流， 你要不歇不眠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你要在夜间打更时起来呼求， 在主面前倾心吐意，如水倒出。 你要为饿昏街头的孩童向主举手祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;“耶和华啊，求你看看， 你曾这样对付过谁呢？ 母亲岂能吃自己生养的孩子？ 祭司和先知岂能在主的圣所中被杀？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;“老人和少年陈尸街头， 少男少女都丧身刀下。 你在发怒的日子杀了他们， 毫不留情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;“你从四面八方召仇敌攻击我， 如同召集人过节。 耶和华发怒的日子， 无人能逃脱，无人能幸免。 敌人杀光了我养育的孩子。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我在耶和华烈怒的杖下受尽痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;祂把我赶进黑暗， 使我行路不见光明，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;又屡屡攻击我，终日不断。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂使我皮肉枯槁， 祂折断我的骨头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;祂使我四面受困， 尝尽痛苦艰辛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂使我住在幽暗中， 像久已死去的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;祂围困我，使我无法逃脱， 祂给我戴上沉重的锁链。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;即使我哀哭呼求， 祂也掩耳不听。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;祂用凿好的石头阻挡我的去路， 使我的道路曲折难行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;祂像埋伏的巨熊， 又像伺机突袭的猛狮，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;把我拖离大路， 撕成碎片，使我一片凄凉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;祂弯弓搭箭，把我当箭靶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祂用箭袋中的箭射穿我的心脏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我成了万民的笑柄， 他们终日唱歌讽刺我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;祂使我饱受苦楚，尝尽苦涩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;祂用石子硌断我的牙齿， 把我践踏在尘土中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你使我失去平安， 忘记了什么是福乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我说：“我精疲力竭， 对耶和华失去盼望。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;想起我的痛苦和漂泊流离， 就如苦艾和胆汁一样苦涩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那情景萦绕心头， 使我心情沉重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;然而，我想起这事， 便有了盼望，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;因为耶和华的慈爱永不终止， 祂的怜悯永无穷尽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;祂的慈爱和怜悯每天早晨都是新的， 祂的信实无比伟大！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;我心里知道， 耶和华是我的福分， 我要仰望祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;耶和华必恩待那些等候和寻求祂的人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;因此，默然等候耶和华的拯救是美好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;年轻时负轭受苦是有益的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;受耶和华管教时， 要默然独坐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;要谦卑地脸伏于地， 或许还有希望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;要任人打脸，甘受凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;因为主不会永远撇弃人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003032",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;主尽管使人忧伤， 祂依然怜悯人， 因为祂有丰盛的慈爱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003033",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:33",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003033",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>33</sup>&nbsp;祂不愿使人忧伤、痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003034",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:34",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003034",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>34</sup>&nbsp;将囚犯踩在脚下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003035",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:35",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003035",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>35</sup>&nbsp;在至高者面前冤枉他人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003036",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:36",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003036",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>36</sup>&nbsp;审理案件时颠倒是非， 都是主所不容许的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003037",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:37",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003037",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>37</sup>&nbsp;若非主发命令， 谁能说成就成呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003038",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:38",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003038",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>38</sup>&nbsp;祸福岂不都出自至高者的口吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003039",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:39",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003039",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>39</sup>&nbsp;世人因自己的罪受罚， 又何必怨天尤人呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003040",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:40",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003040",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>40</sup>&nbsp;让我们省察自己的行为， 重新归向耶和华吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003041",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:41",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003041",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>41</sup>&nbsp;让我们举起双手， 诚心向天上的上帝祷告说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003042",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:42",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003042",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>42</sup>&nbsp;“我们犯罪、背叛， 你没有赦免我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003043",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:43",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003043",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>43</sup>&nbsp;“你满怀愤怒地追赶我们， 毫不留情地杀戮我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003044",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:44",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003044",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>44</sup>&nbsp;你以密云遮盖自己， 以致祷告达不到你那里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003045",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:45",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003045",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>45</sup>&nbsp;你使我们在列国中沦为废物、渣滓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003046",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:46",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003046",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>46</sup>&nbsp;“我们的仇敌都幸灾乐祸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003047",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:47",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003047",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>47</sup>&nbsp;我们充满恐惧， 面临陷阱、残害和毁灭。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003048",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:48",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003048",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>48</sup>&nbsp;因同胞被毁灭，我泪流成河。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003049",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:49",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003049",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>49</sup>&nbsp;我的眼泪涌流不息，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003050",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:50",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003050",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>50</sup>&nbsp;直到耶和华从天上垂顾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003051",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:51",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003051",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>51</sup>&nbsp;目睹城中妇女的遭遇， 我痛苦不已。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003052",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:52",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003052",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>52</sup>&nbsp;敌人无故地追捕我， 如同捕猎飞鸟。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003053",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:53",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003053",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>53</sup>&nbsp;他们把我推进坑里， 又用石头砸我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003054",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:54",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003054",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>54</sup>&nbsp;水已经漫过我的头， 我想我要灭亡了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003055",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:55",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003055",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>55</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊， 我在深坑呼求你的名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003056",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:56",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003056",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>56</sup>&nbsp;你曾垂听我的呼求， 求你现在不要掩耳不听我的求救声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003057",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:57",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003057",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>57</sup>&nbsp;我向你呼求的时候， 你曾走近我身旁， 安慰我说：“不要害怕！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003058",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:58",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003058",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>58</sup>&nbsp;主啊，你为我申了冤， 救赎了我的性命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003059",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:59",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003059",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>59</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，你已明察我的冤情， 求你为我主持公道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003060",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:60",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003060",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>60</sup>&nbsp;你看见了他们怎样仇恨我、 谋害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003061",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:61",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003061",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>61</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊， 你听见了他们怎样辱骂我、 谋害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003062",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:62",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003062",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>62</sup>&nbsp;他们整天诽谤我，图谋害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003063",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:63",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003063",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>63</sup>&nbsp;你看！他们或坐下或起来， 都唱歌讽刺我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003064",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:64",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003064",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>64</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊， 求你按照他们的所作所为报应他们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003065",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:65",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003065",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>65</sup>&nbsp;求你使他们心里刚硬， 让你的咒诅落在他们身上！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003066",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:66",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003066",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>66</sup>&nbsp;求你发怒追赶他们， 从你诸天之下铲除他们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;黄金竟失去光泽， 纯金竟变色， 宝石竟被弃之街头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;锡安的宝贝儿女本来贵如纯金， 现在竟被视为陶匠制作的瓦器！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;豺狼尚且哺养自己的幼儿， 我的百姓却像荒野的鸵鸟般残忍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;婴儿干渴难忍，舌头紧贴上膛； 孩童乞求食物，却无人给予。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;昔日吃美味佳肴的， 如今在街头穷困潦倒； 穿锦衣紫袍长大的， 如今躺卧在粪堆中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;虽然无人攻击，所多玛却在顷刻之间倾覆。 我的百姓比所多玛受到的惩罚更重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;锡安的首领曾比雪纯净， 比奶更白， 身体比红宝石更红润， 相貌美如蓝宝石。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;现在，他们的面目比煤炭还黑， 走在街上无人认得。 他们骨瘦如柴，干如枯木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;死于刀下的胜过死于饥饿的， 就是因田间缺粮而饿死的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的百姓遭毁灭时， 慈母亲手煮自己的儿女充饥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华大发烈怒， 倾倒祂的怒气， 在锡安燃起大火， 焚毁城的根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;地上的君王和世上的居民都不相信敌人能闯进耶路撒冷的城门。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这都是因为她先知的罪行和祭司的过犯。 他们在城中杀害义人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们如盲人在街上游荡， 沾满血污， 无人敢碰他们的衣服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;人们向他们喊道： “走开！你们是不洁的！ 走开！走开！不要靠近我们。” 于是他们逃亡、流荡， 列国的人说： “他们不可再住在我们这里。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和华亲自驱散他们， 不再眷顾他们； 人们不再尊重祭司， 也不再恩待长老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我们望眼欲穿， 盼望援军的到来， 盼望的却是无力拯救之国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;敌人步步紧逼， 使我们不敢上自己的街。 我们的结局近了， 我们的日子到头了， 我们的结局来了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;追赶我们的人比飞鹰更快， 他们在山上追捕我们， 在旷野伏击我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我们的生命之气—— 耶和华膏立的王落入他们的陷阱。 我们原希望借他的荫庇立足于列国中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们住在乌斯地区的以东人啊， 只管欢喜作乐吧！ 因为盛满耶和华愤怒的杯也要传到你们那里。 你们必喝醉，以致赤身露体。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;少女锡安啊！你已经受到了应得的刑罚， 耶和华必不再使你流亡。 少女以东啊，耶和华要因你的罪过而惩罚你， 揭露你的罪恶！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你顾念我们的遭遇， 看看我们所受的耻辱！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我们的土地被陌生人侵占， 我们的房屋落入外族人手中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们成了丧父的孤儿， 我们的母亲成了寡妇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我们喝水要付钱， 烧的柴要用钱买。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;敌人紧追不舍， 我们疲惫不堪，不得安歇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;为了得到食物， 我们向埃及、亚述卑躬屈膝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我们的祖先犯了罪， 已经逝去， 我们却要承担他们的罪责。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;奴仆做了我们的主人， 无人从他们手中解救我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;旷野中杀机四伏， 我们冒着生命危险才得到粮食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们因饥饿而发热， 皮肤热如烤炉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;妇女在锡安遭强暴， 少女在犹大的城邑被奸污。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;首领双手被吊起来， 老人得不到尊敬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;青年被迫推磨， 孩童肩背柴捆，步履蹒跚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;老人不再坐在城门口， 青年不再弹琴奏乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我们心中的快乐消失， 我们的舞蹈变成了哀哭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;荣耀的冠冕从我们头上落下。 我们犯了罪，我们有祸了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;此情此景使我们黯然神伤， 泪眼模糊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;锡安山一片荒凉， 豺狼四处游荡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005019",
